module

public import Theory.SpecificGroups.Rudvalis.Model.Certification

/-!
# Concrete Rudvalis permutation model

`Rudvalis.Model` is the subgroup generated by the standard ATLAS permutations
on 4060 letters. It has group, finiteness and nontriviality instances, a faithful
action, exact generator orders, and a normally generating word of order 29.
The data source and action convention are documented in `Model.PermutationData`.
`simple_of_card_of_primitive` reduces simplicity to the remaining order and
primitivity certificates. This module does not assert recognition from the
order of an arbitrary group.
-/
